This project forks and enhances the open-source Android parental control
application "Child Screen Time" (childscreentime/cst), originally licensed
under open-source terms.

Modifications and extensions in GuardianEye AI:
- 20-20-35 Ophthalmology Rule Engine (EyeCareManager & unskippable overlay)
- 1.5-Hour Daily Entertainment Cap with hard lock enforcer
- Open-Weight AI Study Companion (Llama-3.1-8B-Instant) with diary parsing
- Educational Exemption Manager (pausing entertainment counter during study)
- Anti-Cheat & Anti-Idling Inactivity Monitor
- Pocket Money Consequence Engine (next-day financial accountability)
- Real-time cross-device REST & Server-Sent Events (SSE) telemetry deck
- 7 aesthetic responsive themes (Cyber Cyan, Emerald Matrix, Tokyo Sunset,
  Solar Amber, Nordic Frost, Dracula Crimson, Deep Amethyst)
